    "playback": "Use state-entry time and drawImage source rects. Duration 0 holds until state exit. Recoveries reuse a named visible pose: mimic reveal, bell seek, roof land, groomer recover, leader claim, thief race, collector reveal, procession molt, carillon first-lane. Cast 2 carillon uses second-lane. Painted frame changes drive pose acting; code-native marks are telegraph VFX only.",
    "mobile": "Review at 390x844 and 844x390, small enemies 36–56 CSS px and boss 72–104 CSS px when camera scale permits. Keep poses distinct in grayscale. Use 2 CSS px minimum telegraph strokes and motion/shape plus color. Align feet to collision and keep impacts and safe lanes visible. Limit loaded mutant sheets to these three derived textures, source originals retained outside preload.",
